  "exact_receiving_statement": "theorem erdos_249.variants.rational_mixed_dyadic_observables\n    (D : Finset ℕ) (k : ℕ → ℕ)\n    (f : (d : ℕ) → ZMod (2 ^ (k d)) → ℚ) (B : ℕ) (q₀ : ℚ)\n    (hB : 2 ≤ B)\n    (hpos : ∀ d ∈ D, 0 < d)\n    (hk : ∀ d ∈ D, 0 < k d) :\n    (∃ q : ℚ, (q₀ : ℝ) + (∑ d ∈ D, ∑' n : ℕ,\n      (f d (Nat.totient (n + 1) : ZMod (2 ^ (k d))) : ℝ) /\n        ((B : ℝ) ^ d) ^ (n + 1)) = (q : ℝ)) ↔\n      ∀ d ∈ D, ∀ r : ℕ, r < 2 ^ (k d) → Even r →\n        f d (r : ZMod (2 ^ (k d))) = f d 0",
